WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.208
A lot of the narrative, we saw 
that in the&nbsp;headlines, has been,

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.969
"It's going to do the writing for kids.

00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:06.517
Kids are not going to learn&nbsp;to write."

00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:09.576
But we are showing that there's ways 
that the AI doesn't write for you,

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.961
it writes with&nbsp;you.

00:00:10.961 --> 00:00:12.568
You can say, “I want to write a horror story,”

00:00:12.568 --> 00:00:13.422
and it says,

00:00:13.422 --> 00:00:16.645
"Ooh, a horror story,&nbsp;how 
spine-tingling and thrilling.

00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:19.764
Let's dive into the world of eerie 
shadows and chilling&nbsp;mysteries."

00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:21.347
And this is an activity where

00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:23.313
the student will write two sentences,

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:25.177
and then&nbsp;the AI will write two sentences.

00:00:25.177 --> 00:00:27.943
And so they collaborate together on a story.

00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:30.192
The student&nbsp;writes, "Beatrice was 
a misunderstood ghost.

00:00:30.192 --> 00:00:33.038
She wanted to make friends but 
kept scaring them&nbsp;by accident."

00:00:33.038 --> 00:00:36.988
And the AI says, "Poor Beatrice, a lonely 
spirit yearning for companionship.

00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:40.437
One&nbsp;day she stumbled upon an 
old abandoned mansion," etc.

00:00:40.437 --> 00:00:44.668
I encourage you all to hopefully one&nbsp;
day try this. This is surprisingly fun.

00:00:44.668 --> 00:00:47.214
And we think this is just the very tip

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:50.383
of&nbsp;the iceberg of where this can actually go.

